        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 01-E5, Half Round Knob with St. Charles Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade famous by the French monarch Louis VII, the Fleur-de-lis shape that graces the rose of this door knob represents strength and power. Fusion Hardware's St. Charles Half-Round knob is a great way to add old-world elegance to your home; and the royal history of the Fleur-de-lis only adds to the majesty of this knob and rose combination.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Half Round Knob with St. Charles Rose Fusion 01-E5:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Fleur-de-lis Door Knob Fusion 01-E5:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Half Round Knob with St. Charles Rose, Fusion 01-E5",
                "description": "Half Round Knob with St. Charles Rose Fusion 01-E5 - This knob features the fleur-de-lis along the outer edge, making this old-world looking door knob a must have for those who want to add a royal elegance to their home. Plus, it is available in Oil Rubbed Bronze and Medium Bronze finishes.",
